  << /ActualText (The sofa is not only incredibly stylish\054 but also very comfortable to lounge on\056 The clean lines and minimalist design make it a perfect fit for my modern living room\054 and the neutral color scheme allows me to easily incorporate other accent pieces\056 The sofa is also very sturdy and well\055constructed\054 so I know it will last me for years to come\056\042\n\n\055  Larry Jonhson  \055\n)
